<h1>Slovenian Subcategorization  Grammar for Natural Language Generation</h1>Version of September 11, 2026, 2:11 pm<br />Documentation available at <a href="http://www.unlarchive.org/wiki/index.php/Grammar" target="_blank">http://www.unlarchive.org/wiki/index.php/Grammar</a><br />Tagset available at <a href="../dictionary/export_tagset.php" target="_blank">Export UNDL Foundation tagset</a>.<br /><br /><b>Y0</b><br />AVALENT<br /><br /><b>Y1</b><br />NO SUBCATEGORIZATION FRAME: rules defined inside the entry in the dictionary<br /><br /><b>Y111</b><br />TST2-pred (<i>ščititi</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(NP)VC(PH([pred]));<br /><br /><b>Y113</b><br />TST2-na (<i>bazirati</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(NP)VC(PH([na]));<br /><br /><b>Y115</b><br />TSTI-z (<i>biti v stiku</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(PH([z]));<br /><br /><b>Y117</b><br />TST- (<i>brati</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(NP);<br /><br /><b>Y119</b><br />NTST- (<i>bučati</i>)<br />VS(NP);<br /><br /><b>Y121</b><br />TST2- (<i>darovati</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(NP)VC(NP);<br /><br /><b>Y131</b><br />TSTI-o (<i>dvomiti</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(PH([o]));<br /><br /><b>Y134</b><br />TST2-o (<i>informirati</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(NP)VC(PH([o]));<br /><br /><b>Y139</b><br />TST2-od (<i>ločevati</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(NP)VC(PH([od]));<br /><br /><b>Y143</b><br />TST2-z (<i>napolniti</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(NP)VC(PH([z]));<br /><br /><b>Y145</b><br />TSTI-za (<i>odločiti se</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(PH([za]));<br /><br /><b>Y148</b><br />TSTI-v (<i>pogledati</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(PH([v]));<br /><br /><b>Y155</b><br />TST2-k (<i>pripomniti</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(NP)VC(PH([k]));<br /><br /><b>Y162</b><br />TSTI-pri (<i>sodelovati</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(PH([pri]));<br /><br /><b>Y170</b><br />TST2-za (<i>zaprositi</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(NP)VC(PH([za]));<br /><br /><b>Y203</b><br />TSTI-na (<i>naleteti</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(PH([na]));<br /><br /><b>Y211</b><br />TSTI-iz (<i>prihajati</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(PH([iz]));<br /><br /><b>Y212</b><br />TSTI-k (<i>prispevati</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(PH([k]));<br /><br /><b>Y217</b><br />TSTI-od (<i>biti odvisen</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(PH([od]));<br /><br /><b>Y226</b><br />TST2-v (<i>stlačiti</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(NP)VC(PH([v]));<br /><br /><b>Y228</b><br />TSTI-ob (<i>udariti</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(PH([ob]));<br /><br /><b>Y242</b><br />Subcategorization frame for monotransitive verbs that require a preposition "do". (<i>imeti dostop</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(PH([do]));<br /><br /><b>Y244</b><br />Subcategorization frame for monotransitive verbs that require use of a preposition "pod" as a verb complement. (<i>spadati, dati, pospraviti</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(PH([pod]));<br /><br /><b>Y245</b><br />Subcategorization frame for verbs that require use of the preposition "nad" as the verb complement. (<i>vladati, se dvigniti, nadvladati, prevzeti nadzor,</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(PH([nad]));<br /><br /><b>Y248</b><br />Frame for ditransitive verbs that require preposition "iz". (<i>potegniti, izvleči</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(NP)VC(PH([iz]));<br /><br /><b>Y251</b><br />Subcategorization frame for verbs that require a preposition "skozi". (<i>preiti, iti</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(PH([skozi]));<br /><br /><b>Y252</b><br />Subcategorization frame for montransitive verb that require preposition "pred". (<i>se skriti, zbežati</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(PH([pred]));<br /><br /><b>Y253</b><br />Subcategorization frame for ditransitive verbs that require a preposition "pri". (<i>zmotiti,presenetiti</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(NP)VC(PH([pri]));<br /><br /><b>Y254</b><br />Frame for verbs that require preposition "proti". (<i>boriti se, govoriti</i>)<br />VS(NP)VC(NP)VC(PH([proti]));<br /><br /><b>Y285</b><br />P1- (<i>pred</i>)<br />PC(NP);
